title: "AIS Mobility Data Warehouse"
abstract: "A reproducible spatiotemporal data warehouse on one day of Danish Maritime Authority AIS data (15.8 million reports): logged cleaning rules, MobilityDB trips, a star schema with OLAP queries, and a spatial index benchmark."
